    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0109" n="95" sameAs="frus:frus1947v06/pg95"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851G.00/5–947: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Vice Consul at Hanoi</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >O’Sullivan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanoi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-05-09T17:00:00+08:00">May 9, 1947—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>156. According French monitoring service, Radio Vietnam stated May 8 that Giam
                    made following declaration (<hi rendition="#italic">Summary</hi>): <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Three years ago United States recognized independence Philippines. If in
                            near future we learn recognition of Indonesian and Vietnam Republics by
                            great American Republic, that measure will surprise no one. Such measure
                            would do honor to United States, increase United States prestige and
                            influence in world and contribute effectively establishment peace
                            Southeast Asia.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Repeat to Paris.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Sullivan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
